@startuml
!include PlantUML.style
' !pragma layout smetana


hide empty description

state "Cerrado\nClosed" as Closed
state "Abierto\nOpen" as Open
state "Semiabierto\nHalfOpen" as HalfOpen

[*] --> Closed
Closed -right-> Open : falla la mitad en 10 s,\ncon 5 llamadas o más\n//CircuitFailureRatio//\n//CircuitSamplingDuration//\n//OnOpened//
Open -down-> HalfOpen : pasan 15 s\n//CircuitBreakDuration//\n//OnHalfOpened//
HalfOpen -up-> Open : llamada de prueba falla\n//OnOpened//
HalfOpen -left-> Closed : llamada de prueba funciona\n//OnClosed//
note bottom of Open : las llamadas fallan de inmediato,\nsin llegar a Products
@enduml
